{"version":1,"key":"card:73","content":{"id":73,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Obsidian 官方的同步很贵，用不起，但是为了能在移动端和 PC 端都能使用 Obsidian，同步时必须要做的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果没有 Android 手机，那么时很好同步的，因为 PC 和 iPhone 可以通过 iCloud 来进行同步，并且是实时的，但是 Android 手机上无法使用 iCloud，两种办法："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其它云同步软件：坚果云，谷歌云、OneDrive"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Git"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"坚果云是属实有毛病，每次只能同步几百个文件，光同步都要好久，不可取，因为其它的我也想用 iCloud，无法直接同步 iCloud 中的东西，反正折腾了很久，云同步这边失败了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面来到了 Git，有一个插件 Obsidian-Git，但是我试了，没有任何内容下载，不知道什么情况。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后下了个安卓的软件 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MGit","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，发现无法下载私人仓库，输了密码也一直说没权限，无语，但是由于笔记中有日记，所以另开了仓库，放无日记版的笔记，做法就是另开了一个分支 mobile，然后不追踪日记这个文件夹，并把 mobile 这个分支的内容推到另一个仓库。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过这样当每次 master 分支改动时，我都要 merge 到 mobile，然后推送，然后在手机端手动下拉，很麻烦，不过链路跑通，能用，先这样吧。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在折腾的过程也收获了一些 Git 和 Github 的操作，见："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Github 删除分支"}],"refId":93,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":89},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Git 不追踪已经提交了的文件"}],"refId":49,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":46},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["Obsidian"],"createTime":1689167136076,"updateTime":1744172349649,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744172349649},"links":{"card:93":{"key":"card:93","type":"card","id":93},"card:49":{"key":"card:49","type":"card","id":49}}}